<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed flat, meal prices flat-down.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed flat, meal prices flat-down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed values were unchanged Monday and meal values were flat to lower, dealers said. Some dealers anticipate a flurry of buying on Wednesday or Thursday in front of the July 4th three-day weekend.    </p>
<p>CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
